      "reply": "Hi Casey,\n\nThanks for reaching out. Refunds are issued to the original payment method within 5 business days after the returned item arrives at our warehouse and passes inspection [9]. Banks can take an additional 3 to 10 business days to show the refund on a card statement [9].\n\nLet me know if there's anything else I can help with.",
