      "reply": "Hi Casey,\n\nThanks for reaching out. Opened earbuds and in-ear products can be returned within the same 30 days, but the ear tips must be removed and discarded for hygiene reasons [7]. If one earbud still doesn't play, do a factory reset [27].\n\nLet me know if there's anything else I can help with.",
