      "unsupported_claims": [],
      "retrieval_ms": 10,
      "generation_ms": 0,
      "reply": "Hi Casey,\n\nThanks for reaching out. | Method | Delivery time | Cost |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Standard | 3\u20135 business days | Free on orders over $50, otherwise $6.95 |\n| Express | 1\u20132 business days | $14.95 |\n| International | 7\u201314 business days | Calculated at checkout |\n\nOrders placed before 2 pm Eastern Time on a business day ship the same day [12]. Packages refused because of unpaid duties are not eligible for a refund of the original shipping cost [13].\n\nLet me know if there's anything else I can help with.",
      "error": null
    },
