      "reply": "Hi Casey,\n\nThanks for reaching out. Customers can change the shipping address or cancel an order within 1 hour of placing it, from Account > Orders [14]. A confirmation link is sent to the new address and the change only takes effect once it is confirmed [3].\n\nLet me know if there's anything else I can help with.",
