      "permission_violations": 0,
      "unsupported_claims": [],
      "retrieval_ms": 12,
      "generation_ms": 0,
      "reply": "Hi Casey,\n\nThanks for reaching out. Battery capacity is covered: if a battery holds less than 70% of its original capacity within the 2-year warranty period, the product qualifies for a warranty replacement [16]. Battery capacity below 70% within 2 years of delivery is covered by the warranty [22].\n\nLet me know if there's anything else I can help with.",
      "error": null
